# Jobs API

Express + Prisma. Customer app: `jobAndEducation-Hub-Next-JS-Final_Branch`. Public API base: `https://jobs.devminds.net/backend`.

- Routes: `src/routes/*.js`. Logic: `src/services/*.controller.js`. Validation: `src/validation/*.schema.js`.
- One Prisma client from `src/lib/prisma.js`. Hosting flags from `src/lib/runtime.js`.
- `DB_PROVIDER` selects mysql, postgresql, or sqlite in `prisma.config.ts`.
- `HOSTING_PLATFORM=vercel` forces Redis, Elasticsearch, Socket.IO, and BullMQ off. VPS uses `HOSTING_PLATFORM=local` and the same variables. Do not hardcode hosts.
- Vercel Hobby `maxDuration` is 10 seconds (`vercel.json`, `api/index.js`). Raise it only on a paid Vercel plan.
- Feature diagrams: `docs/features/`. Deploy: `docs/vercel-deployment.md`, `docs/ubuntu.md`, `docs/docker.md`. Agent index: `AGENTS.md`.
- There is no `.codegraph/` index until someone runs `codegraph init`. Do not invent graph relationships.
